StarCompanion is an unofficial Star Citizen fan project and is not affiliated
with or endorsed by Cloud Imperium Games. Star Citizen and related marks and
game content remain the property of their respective owners.

Smart Citizen was used as a behavior and feature reference. No Smart Citizen
implementation code is included in StarCompanion.

The optional numeric mining-signature pack preserves factual values from
MrKraken's historical StarStrings project (commit
b83d58baedf71b090903b9ec34186520907271f9). It is community-authored data,
disabled by default, and accepted only for an explicitly reviewed game build.

The MIT-licensed dolkensp/unp4k project by Peter Dolkens was consulted as a
DataForge/P4K format reference. No unp4k implementation code or binary is
included in StarCompanion.
